flowchart LR
    U[Customer/User]

    P31((3.1 View Cart))
    P32((3.2 Add to Cart))
    P33((3.3 Update Quantity))
    P34((3.4 Remove from Cart))
    P35((3.5 Recalculate Total))

    D2[(D2 Products)]
    D3[(D3 Cart and Cart Items)]

    U -->|open cart| P31
